，斬首捕虜，上功莫府，一言不相應，文吏以法繩之。其賞不行而吏奉法必用。臣愚，以爲陛下法太明，賞太輕，罰太重。且雲中守魏尚坐上功首虜差六級，陛下下之吏，削其爵，罰作之。由此言之，陛下雖得廉頗、李牧，弗能用也。臣誠愚，觸忌諱，死罪死罪！」文帝説。是日令馮唐持節赦魏尚，復以爲雲中守，而拜唐爲車騎都尉，主中尉及郡國車士。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"卬","kind":"person","person_id":"97s_gzq_ow9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"065_z0k_4dc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"唐","kind":"person","person_id":"rl6_a40_3hj_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"廉頗","kind":"person","person_id":"mag_s6n_b0c","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"1as_2bm_qu5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"唐","kind":"person","person_id":"rl6_a40_3hj_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0058","start":58,"end":62,"surface":"上古王者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、典故或待辨指代；父老與父知之乎在本段為對馮唐的稱呼，不新增馮唐父親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0114","start":114,"end":116,"surface":"大父","kind":"person","person_id":"rl6_a40_3hj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"1as_2bm_qu5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0156","start":156,"end":158,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"1as_2bm_qu5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-102-zhangfeng:m012-0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"單于","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、典故或待辨指代；父老與父知之乎在本段為對馮唐的稱呼，不新增馮唐父親。"},{"id"